people. Indeed in that is a sign for a people who give thought.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"16:70","t":"And Allāh created you; then He will take you in death. And among you is he who is reversed to the most decrepit [old] age so that he will not know, after [having had] knowledge, a thing. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing and Competent.","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"16:71","t":"And Allāh has favored some of you over others in provision. But those who were favored [i.e., given more] would not hand over their provision to those whom their right hands possess [i.e., slaves] so they would be equal to them therein. Then is it the favor of Allāh they reject?","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"16:72","t":"And Allāh has made for you from yourselves mates and has made for you from your mates sons and grandchildren and has provided for you from the good things. Then in falsehood do they believe and in the favor of Allāh they disbelieve?","j":14,"h":28,"s":16,"a":72,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":28,"surahs":[16],"sajdah":false}